\title{Shadow}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2023-10-01}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{For #{1 \leq r \leq n}, the \em{lower shadow} or simply \em{shadow} of a family of sets #{\mathcal{A} \subset X^{(r)}} is}

##{\underline{\partial}^{(r)}\mathcal{A} = \lbrace B \in X^{(r-1)} : B \subset A, A \in \mathcal{A}\rbrace , 
 \qquad (2)}

\p{so by \ref{CC08} of \ref{CC02},}

##{|\underline{\partial}^{(r)}\mathcal{A}| \geq \frac{r}{n - r + 1}|\mathcal{A}|. 
 \qquad (3)}
